      {
        "id": 21,
        "code": "% 컴파일 및 저장\n\\+ \\+ (\n    compile_recursive(factorial/2, [], _BashCode),\n    % 함수 정의만 유지 (Brush는 source된 스크립트를 직접 실행으로 처리함)\n    split_string(_BashCode, \"\\n\", \"\\r\", _BashLines),\n    append(_LibraryLines, [\"# Auto-execute when run directly (not when sourced)\"|_], _BashLines),\n    atomics_to_string(_LibraryLines, \"\\n\", _LibraryCode),\n    setup_call_cleanup(\n        open('../output/factorial_demo.sh', write, _Stream),\n        write(_Stream, _LibraryCode),\n        close(_Stream)),\n    writeln('✓ Compiled factorial to Bash with fold-based linear recursion')\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: compile_recursive/3",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: compile_recursive/3</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 22,
        "code": "### 생성된 Bash 테스트",
        "type": "markdown",
