        "code": "% 컴파일 및 저장\n\\+ \\+ (\n    compile_recursive(tree_sum/2, [], _BashCode),\n    setup_call_cleanup(\n        open('../output/tree_sum_demo.sh', write, _Stream),\n        write(_Stream, _BashCode),\n        close(_Stream)),\n    writeln('✓ Compiled tree_sum to Bash with tree recursion')\n).",
        "type": "code",
